<title>JAPAN: Daishowa seen posting biggest group prft in 96/97.</title>
<headline>Daishowa seen posting biggest group prft in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daishowa Paper Manufacturing Co Ltd is expected to post a record group net profit of 14 billion yen in the year to next March 31, a Japanese newspaper said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Nihon Keizai Shimbun said the expected rise was due to robust demand for newsprint overseas.</p>
<p>The company, which has had group losses for the last several years, posted a group net loss of 2.69 billion yen in 1995/96.</p>
<p>The company declined to comment on the report.</p>
</text>
